WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.471
Every council, agency and charity runs on technology.

00:00:04.471 --> 00:00:07.758
Most of it was bought one contract at a time.

00:00:09.158 --> 00:00:11.026
So we start with discovery.

00:00:11.026 --> 00:00:16.629
We listen to your people, walk every site, and see how the work really gets done.

00:00:18.029 --> 00:00:19.862
Then we map every vendor.

00:00:19.862 --> 00:00:26.388
Every contract, every licence, every renewal date, and who to call when something breaks.

00:00:27.788 --> 00:00:30.961
Most organisations find more than they expected.

00:00:30.961 --> 00:00:36.382
Tools that overlap, gaps that nobody owns, and renewals rolling over on their own.

00:00:37.782 --> 00:00:40.588
We check it all against what matters to you.

00:00:40.588 --> 00:00:47.029
The Essential Eight, where your data lives, and what you owe the public, your board and your funders.

00:00:48.429 --> 00:00:50.197
Next comes a clear plan.

00:00:50.197 --> 00:00:57.415
What to keep, what to combine, and what to replace, timed to your budget cycle or your next grant.

00:00:58.815 --> 00:01:04.771
Change is about people, so we bring your staff and volunteers along, step by step.

00:01:06.171 --> 00:01:11.317
Then we move you across in phases, with no disruption to the people you serve.

00:01:12.717 --> 00:01:14.397
And we stay accountable.

00:01:14.397 --> 00:01:21.468
One point of contact, plain-English reports, and every solution security-vetted by Strikeforce Cyber.

00:01:22.868 --> 00:01:24.036
Code Black Group.

00:01:24.036 --> 00:01:28.432
Technology that protects your mission, and the people you serve.
